           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">The hook</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We hope that this information about the Asian elephant, and the Khao Sok national park elephant in particular, will help you to appreciate them during your visit to Khao Sok. Do try and get to know the Thai elephant and support the people that look after them. Also try and visit the <a href="/khao-sok-elephant-sanctuary/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok elephant retirement sanctuary</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>The main thing is to spread the love for these amazing creatures.</strong>
        </p>
